spec.text:
{
  "id": "T-302",
  "milestone": "M2",
  "depends_on": [
    "T-301"
  ],
  "title": "A worker's first round returns one plan with every question and how each done line will be proven, builds only after firstmate accepts it, and every fix covers the whole class of its problem",
  "public_title": "Full plan first, and fix each problem class whole",
  "scope": [
    "skills/worker/**",
    "bin/fm-worker.sh",
    "bin/fm-canary.sh",
    "bin/lib/**",
    "tests/**",
    "design/design.md",
    "design/tasks/T-302.json"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "Why. Since T-297 a worker's first round reads the spec and code, but it stops at its first question or, with none, writes a short plan and builds in the same round. On T-299 (2026-10-12) two questions that one reading could find came in two rounds, and no one saw that a done line (browser tests proven by fail-first) could not be proven by the existing CI until a review rejected it; the task took about ten worker rounds and two reviews. The captain's rule (2026-10-12): never ask one question at a time; always list every question, and fix the whole class of a problem, not one instance.",
    "What, one plan. A first round (on a new task or after a repin) changes no file and returns one plan: every question it has, all at once; the files it will change; and for each done line of the spec, the test that proves it, where that test runs (which CI job or suite) and how it fails on the base. A round with nothing to ask still returns the plan.",
    "What, accept before build. The next round builds only after firstmate records that it accepts the plan, with its answers to the questions; the worker launcher refuses to start a build round on a plan that has not been accepted. Firstmate goes to the captain only when an answer changes what or why.",
    "What, whole class. When a round fixes a problem (a review finding, a red CI line, an answer to a question), it finds every other place in the change with the same cause and fixes them too, and its report lists the places it checked. A round that has questions lists all of them at once, never one per round.",
    "What, unchanged. Later rounds, review, and rounds of external projects work as today.",
    "Done, tests. A first round that changes a file is refused and nothing is pushed (`worker: first round changes nothing`, fail-first); a plan missing a row for a done line is refused, naming the line (`worker: plan covers every done line`, fail-first); a build round on an unaccepted plan is refused and on an accepted one starts (`worker: build after accepted plan`, fail-first). A fix round's report without the list of places checked for the same class is refused (`worker: fix lists its class`, fail-first).",
    "Docs. The worker skill and the design section that describes the worker's first round say this."
  ],
  "explain": {
    "en": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "A first round returns every question and a proof row per done line."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "A build round starts only after firstmate accepts the plan."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Each fix covers every place with the same cause."
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "On T-299 questions came one per round, and a done line that no test proved reached review."
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "the worker first round",
        "the worker launcher",
        "tests"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "review",
        "later rounds"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 1: a test shows a plan without a proof row is refused."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 2: a test shows a build waits for an accepted plan."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 3: a test shows a fix report without its class list is refused."
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Each task gets one short planning round before it builds."
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Read spec and code"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "Ask one or build"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Build and push"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Read spec and code"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "Full plan, then accept"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Build and push"
        }
      ]
    },
    "zh-TW": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "第一輪一次交出所有問題，每條完成條件都附證明方式。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "firstmate 接受計畫後，才開始實作那一輪。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "每次修正都涵蓋同一原因的所有地方。"
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "T-299 一輪只問一題，一條證明不了的完成條件一路拖到審查。"
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "worker 第一輪",
        "worker 啟動器",
        "測試"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "審查",
        "之後的輪次"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 1：測試證明缺證明列的計畫遭到拒收。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 2：測試證明實作要等計畫獲得接受。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 3：測試證明缺同類清單的修正報告遭到拒收。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "每個任務在實作前多一輪簡短的規劃。"
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "讀 spec 和程式碼"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "問一題或直接做"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "實作並推送"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "讀 spec 和程式碼"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "完整計畫，接受後做"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "實作並推送"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
